  "The seed sets the initial weights and the order of training examples. Keep it fixed to compare settings fairly. Changing it restarts the current experiment; the same seed does not guarantee identical results across different training engines.": "La semilla determina los pesos iniciales y el orden de los ejemplos. Mantenla fija para comparar ajustes. Cambiarla reinicia el experimento actual; una misma semilla no garantiza resultados idénticos entre distintos motores.",
